    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d40">

                <pb facs="0149" n="37" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg37"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 835.73/69</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">De Billier</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-10-06T12:00:00-04:16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 6, 1916, noon.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s September 28, 4 p.m. No menace to the life of the concession by
                    present administration. Will suggest by next mail what course the telegraph
                    company should probably pursue.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">De Billier</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
